---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title={"Dokumen Resmi — TIDAR"} description={"Kumpulan dokumen resmi TIDAR yang dapat dilihat dan diunduh."} bodyClass={"inner-page official-documents-page logo-page"} extraCss={["/pages.css"]}>
<main id="main"><section aria-labelledby="mlHeroTitle" class="ml-hero">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-shape">
<svg focusable="false" preserveaspectratio="none" viewbox="0 0 1600 560">
<defs>
<lineargradient id="mlHeroRedGradient" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1">
<stop offset="0" stop-color="#ef101c"></stop>
<stop offset="0.48" stop-color="#e20d19"></stop>
<stop offset="1" stop-color="#c80712"></stop>
</lineargradient>
<pattern height="22" id="mlHeroDotPattern" patternunits="userSpaceOnUse" width="22">
<circle cx="3" cy="3" fill="#ffffff" fill-opacity="0.14" r="1.7"></circle>
</pattern>
</defs>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-red" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroRedGradient)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-dots" d="M0 0H1145C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560H0Z" fill="url(#mlHeroDotPattern)"></path>
<path class="ml-hero-shape-edge" d="M1145 0C1112 105 1075 215 1028 326C975 450 905 535 760 560" fill="none"></path>
</svg>
</div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-ribbons"></div>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-dots"></div>
<div class="ml-hero-inner">
<div class="ml-hero-copy">
<p class="ml-eyebrow">Transparansi Organisasi</p>
<h1 class="ml-hero-title" id="mlHeroTitle"><span>DOKUMEN</span><span>RESMI</span></h1>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="ml-hero-rule"></div>
<p class="ml-hero-lead">Akses Manifesto, AD/ART TIDAR, dan Peraturan Organisasi dalam satu pusat dokumen resmi.</p>
</div>
<figure class="ml-garuda-panel">
<img alt="Garuda Pancasila, lambang negara Republik Indonesia" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="1042" src="/assets/garuda-pancasila-authentic.webp" width="960"/>
<figcaption class="ml-garuda-caption"><span>Lambang Negara</span><span>Republik Indonesia</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="officialDocumentsTitle" class="content-section official-documents-section">
<div class="container official-documents-hub">
<div class="official-documents-intro official-documents-intro--editorial">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="official-documents-intro__meta">
<span class="official-documents-intro__line"></span>
<span>ARSIP ORGANISASI</span>
<strong>03</strong>
<small>Dokumen utama</small>
</div>
<div class="official-documents-intro__copy">
<p class="section-label">Pusat Dokumen</p>
<h2 id="officialDocumentsTitle">Landasan organisasi yang dapat diakses secara terbuka</h2>
</div>
<p class="official-documents-intro__lead">Setiap dokumen dapat dibaca melalui halaman penampil khusus atau diunduh langsung dalam format PDF.</p>
</div>
<div class="official-documents-grid official-documents-grid--editorial">
<article class="official-document-card official-document-card--featured">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="official-document-card__visual official-document-card__visual--red">
<span class="official-document-card__number">01</span>
<div class="official-document-card__filemark">
<svg focusable="false" viewbox="0 0 80 96"><path d="M16 6h34l18 18v66H16z"></path><path d="M50 6v20h18"></path><path d="M28 44h28M28 56h28M28 68h20"></path></svg>
<strong>PDF</strong>
</div>
<span class="official-document-card__code">MANIFESTO / 2022</span>
</div>
<div class="official-document-card__copy">
<p>Manifesto Kongres III TIDAR 2022</p>
<h2>Manifesto</h2>
<p>Dokumen arah perjuangan dan komitmen organisasi yang ditetapkan dalam Kongres III TIDAR.</p>
</div>
<div class="official-document-card__actions"><a class="action-btn action-btn--red" href="/dokumen-resmi-manifesto">Lihat Dokumen <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="action-btn" download="" href="/assets/manifesto-2022.pdf">Unduh PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
</article>
<article class="official-document-card official-document-card--compact">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="official-document-card__visual official-document-card__visual--gold">
<span class="official-document-card__number">02</span>
<div class="official-document-card__filemark">
<svg focusable="false" viewbox="0 0 80 96"><path d="M16 6h34l18 18v66H16z"></path><path d="M50 6v20h18"></path><path d="M28 44h28M28 56h28M28 68h20"></path></svg>
<strong>PDF</strong>
</div>
<span class="official-document-card__code">AD/ART / 2022</span>
</div>
<div class="official-document-card__copy">
<p>Anggaran Dasar &amp; Anggaran Rumah Tangga</p>
<h2>AD/ART TIDAR</h2>
<p>Landasan organisasi yang mengatur identitas, keanggotaan, struktur, serta tata kelola TIDAR.</p>
</div>
<div class="official-document-card__actions"><a class="action-btn action-btn--red" href="/dokumen-resmi-ad-art">Lihat Dokumen <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="action-btn" download="" href="/assets/ad-art-2022.pdf">Unduh PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
</article>
<article class="official-document-card official-document-card--compact">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="official-document-card__visual official-document-card__visual--dark">
<span class="official-document-card__number">03</span>
<div class="official-document-card__filemark">
<svg focusable="false" viewbox="0 0 80 96"><path d="M16 6h34l18 18v66H16z"></path><path d="M50 6v20h18"></path><path d="M28 44h28M28 56h28M28 68h20"></path></svg>
<strong>PDF</strong>
</div>
<span class="official-document-card__code">PERATURAN / 2022</span>
</div>
<div class="official-document-card__copy">
<p>Peraturan Organisasi TIDAR 2022</p>
<h2>Peraturan Organisasi</h2>
<p>Pedoman pelaksanaan organisasi untuk menjaga ketertiban, konsistensi, dan profesionalisme kepengurusan.</p>
</div>
<div class="official-document-card__actions"><a class="action-btn action-btn--red" href="/dokumen-resmi-peraturan-organisasi">Lihat Dokumen <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="action-btn" download="" href="/assets/peraturan-organisasi-2022.pdf">Unduh PDF <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section></main>
</BaseLayout>
